{"step_index":438,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-14T01:37:17Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-14T10:37:17+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-14T10:37:19+09:00\nThe search for \"\"저스티스어드벤처\" (\"051\" OR \"010\" OR \"070\" OR \"02\")\" returned the following summary:\n**(주)저스티스어드벤처**는 부산광역시(해운대구 센텀스카이비즈 등)에 본사를 둔 응용 소프트웨어 개발 및 공급업, 벤처 육성·운영 관련 중소기업입니다[1][2][3]. \n\n기업의 본사 위치가 **부산** 지역이므로, 유선 전화번호가 존재할 경우 지역번호 **051**을 사용할 가능성이 가장 높습니다[4].\n\nSources:\n[1] [incruit.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGQTO4iph_wKmlV0mAubv0csTXaKuqRgSPhXpUxWXBIyb4HOpP1dXHBph6vybfIZA-hJLZunG2hFYdLpkh5nRUxFyPOB4yVBOyMqqSMttTu-ZQMIKWgle6IxGfZFRis3x3x)\n[2] [saramin.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFwio4q0HkxzlKy1bJYM7B9jKR0DJh0xi6iu_3KlSKduUVfy3iGAMxpfvmOzUVp5H_BNNKlB7NjgHWYMeaLxuTsNunaVZJ747cxtNZfPtvpB2hfQhTH_XVChSq4_MMWqj-w-519XmDqDWpR-1jlgZNrxvIDmHPt7fl7Ox0-NMuQC7Oud_W42IdVc6-ulsNmDDMegCZ2cccZrZV5X-Dni9hNy0qrR6bMDbMIfNI_)\n[3] [bolta.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGgXJXS7ouueEbHwrJsXSiySU2UNYWq1UBA-_oIqaUPCxTLU-IDsxqb5B2KyklstDBPXMonADihxVeslTJx_-XOx-384qRNdB5ZGjx2YYDWXVBQA9vv)\n[4] [reportworld.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGS_ko2ZoT0Ti_4AZhzZempNZfHX4361dCep5a45FhYMNtTtuli8FC-jUbIxYBKl3v_tqVhrxAIc8QoZG3Ylx6-v3XTRBD8F7bRqpSscvhrm_dfGIGACDjk4hp6wHrZ7obJ37HKvWtv-I0vToi3XHk_oMD_hEP1WzFg9ZW7qCKHIeSxICkOBAFJJyH8kZCz_TOQ7BAUjIA65d--updTXGYb1NZ3)"}
